{
  "name": "Do I need a car on the Amalfi Coast?",
  "parent_id": 230624347930176,
  "group_id": "0758d172-8ead-405b-a19c-86d8b15814f1",
  "alternates": [],
  "created_at": "2026-10-15T07:20:06.574Z",
  "deleted_at": null,
  "sort_by_date": null,
  "tag_list": [],
  "updated_at": "2026-11-10T20:56:25.346Z",
  "published_at": "2026-11-10T20:56:25.315Z",
  "id": 230847310150332,
  "uuid": "e46431f0-5a2d-42fa-ac57-b7ff018cc1fa",
  "is_folder": false,
  "content": {
    "_uid": "c1aad5e7-ef9e-4941-8223-9e2cf5e66706",
    "answer": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "No. The coast road, the SS163, is narrow and slow in summer, and parking in the towns is scarce and costly.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "SITA buses and seasonal ferries link the main towns.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "question": "Do I need a car?",
    "component": "faq_item",
    "answer__i18n__de": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Nein. Die Küstenstraße SS163 ist schmal und im Sommer nur langsam befahrbar, und Parkplätze in den Orten sind knapp und teuer.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "SITA-Busse und saisonale Fähren verbinden die wichtigsten Orte.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "answer__i18n__es": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "No. La carretera de la costa, la SS163, es estrecha y lenta en verano, y aparcar en los pueblos es difícil y caro.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Los autobuses de SITA y los ferris de temporada conectan las principales localidades.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "answer__i18n__fr": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Non. La route côtière, la SS163, est étroite et lente en été, et le stationnement dans les villes est rare et coûteux.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Les bus SITA et les ferries saisonniers relient les principales villes.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "question__i18n__de": "Brauche ich ein Auto?",
    "question__i18n__es": "¿Necesito coche?",
    "question__i18n__fr": "Ai-je besoin d'une voiture ?"
  },
